        Disponible para colaborar
      </div>

      <h3
        class="mb-8 max-w-[760px] font-serif text-[clamp(54px,5vw,96px)] leading-[0.9] tracking-[-0.05em] text-[var(--white)]"
      >

        Construyamos algo

        <em class="block italic text-[var(--white-dim)]">
          con identidad propia.
        </em>

      </h3>

      <p
        class="max-w-[560px] text-[17px] leading-[1.95] text-[var(--white-muted)]"
      >

        Me interesa colaborar en proyectos donde
        el diseño, la experiencia y el frontend
        tengan el mismo nivel de importancia.

      </p>

    </div>

    <!-- Right -->
    <div class="mr-6 grid gap-[1px] border border-[var(--rule)] bg-[var(--rule)]">

      <!-- Email -->
      <a
        href="mailto:jorge@email.com"
        class="group flex items-center justify-between bg-[var(--bg3)] px-7 py-6 transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-[rgba(139,26,26,0.05)]"
      >

        <div>

          <div
            class="mb-2 font-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-[rgba(139,26,26,0.62)]"
          >
            Email
          </div>

          <div
            class="font-serif text-[clamp(24px,2vw,38px)] leading-none text-[var(--white)]"
          >
            jorge@email.com
          </div>

        </div>

        <span
          class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-[rgba(139,26,26,0.72)] transition duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1"
        >
          →
        </span>

      </a>

      <!-- GitHub -->
      <a
        href="#"
        class="group flex items-center justify-between bg-[var(--bg3)] px-7 py-6 transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-[rgba(139,26,26,0.05)]"
      >

        <div>

          <div
            class="mb-2 font-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-[rgba(139,26,26,0.62)]"
